eepen the Foundations — understanding the deep structure of our systems, strengthening \\nthe theory, and letting AI loops amplify that understanding. This is the shape of theory and \\nthe shape of implementation at work. \\nTake It to the World — understanding what the market wants, discovering the right ideas, \\nselling, and building the right thing. Engineers take up product thinking. PMs and BD teams \\nbuild technical depth. Everyone becomes cross-functional. This is the shape of domain and \\nthe shape of nature at work. \\n \\n \\nDEEPEN THE FOUNDATIONS \\nShape of Theory + Agentic Loops \\nThese tracks build the core capabilities that compound over time. They are about understanding \\nthe deep structure of what we build and letting AI amplify that understanding. Every investment \\nhere makes everything else we do faster, cheaper, and more reliable. \\nNamma Cloud & Distributed Systems \\nWe are building Namma DSL — a declarative spec for the entire infrastructure layer. Combined \\nwith Kubernetes, our investment in active-active architectures, and a new clustered Namma DB, \\nthis becomes a service we can provide across the world. On-premise is going to grow as \\norganisations pursue cost optimisation and sovereignty. We are positioning to run 1,000+ stacks \\nat a fraction of public cloud costs, with the reliability and operational maturity that comes from \\nrunning India’s payments infrastructure. \\n\\n\\nQuery: What tracks are mentioned?\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T11:00:54.289Z\",\n        \"durationMs\": 1,\n        \"response\": {\n          \"answer\": \"Mock answer based on document section.\",\n          \"entities\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"concept\",\n              \"name\": \"Mock Entity\",\n              \"confidence\": 0.9\n            }\n          ],\n          \"relevantExcerpt\": \"Mock relevant excerpt from the document.\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"groupId\": 