ystem\",\n            \"content\": \"You are a document analysis agent. Provide a concise summary relevant to the query.\\nRespond with JSON: { \\\"answer\\\": \\\"summary text\\\", \\\"entities\\\": [], \\\"relevantExcerpt\\\": \\\"key quote\\\" }\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"Section: FinOps — Value Creation Platform\\nPages: 3 to 3\\n\\nContent:\\nJUSPAY  |  10x Opportunity Tracks \\nTAKE IT TO THE WORLD \\nShape of Domain + Product Work \\nThese tracks are about understanding what the market wants, what people need, discovering the \\nright ideas, selling them, and building the right thing. This is where engineers take up product \\nthinking, where PMs and BD teams build technical fluency, where domain depth translates into \\nrevenue, and where we go from India traction to 10+ countries. Everyone becomes \\ncross-functional. Every customer relationship deepens our understanding, which deepens the \\nproduct, which attracts the next customer. \\nGlobal Banking Infrastructure \\nWe have a proven track record of building deep tech for financial infrastructure, demonstrated \\nby our role in scaling UPI in India. That same capability is now needed globally. Latin America, \\nAfrica, and Southeast Asia represent high-potential, greenfield opportunities for companies that \\ncan bring deep technology to banks in emerging markets — from payments processing and \\nacquiring to corporate and transaction banking. \\nThe compounding effect: Domain expertise compounds across geographies. Each country \\nwe enter adds domain knowledge and network effects that make the next country easier to win. \\nThe playbook sharpens with every deployment. \\nAgentic Commerce Infrastructure \\nWhat we did with ONDC is going to become real — decentralised commerce is a big shift, for \\nboth B2C and B2B. AI agents are beginning to discover, research, transact, and settle. The rails \\nfor agent-driven commerce do not exist yet. We are building them — from B2B procurement \\nautomation to consumer-facing agent-driven purchasing. This is the infrastructure layer for a \\nnew kind of commerce where agents negotiate, compare, and transact on behalf of humans and \\nbusinesses. \\nThe compounding effect: Agent transaction volume is on an S-curve of its own. Early \\nposition on these rails compounds as the curve steepens. And decentralised commerce (the \\nONDC model) multiplied by AI agents creates a network effect: every new participant makes \\nthe network more valuable for agents, and every agent makes the network more valuable for \\nparticipants. \\nFinOps — Value Creation Platform \\nManaging money is managing resource allocation — the ability to de-risk and increase \\npossibility. This is one of the oldest and most universal problems in organisations. We are \\nbuilding a platform that goes beyond traditional expense management into intelligent, \\ndecentralised resource allocation — enabling smart spending, procurement automation, and \\nAI-driven research for purchases. This integrates deeply with Xyne’s collaboration layer, because \\nresource allocation decisions are fundamentally collaborative decisions. \\n\\n\\nQuery: What tracks are mentioned?\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T11:00:54.290Z\",\n        \"durationMs\": 0,\n        \"response\": {\n          \"answer\": \"Mock answer based on document section.\",\n          \"entities\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"concept\",\n              \"name\": \"Mock Entity\",\n              \"confidence\": 0.9\n            }\n          ],\n          \"relevantExcerpt\": \"Mock relevant excerpt from the document.\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"mergeResult\": {\n    \"type\": \"synthesis\",\n    \"reasoning\": \"Multiple sections synthesized into comprehensive answer\",\n    \"durationMs\": 1,\n    \"llmCall\": {\n      \"agentType\": \"synthesis\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n   