es. \\nThe compounding effect: Agent transaction volume is on an S-curve of its own. Early \\nposition on these rails compounds as the curve steepens. And decentralised commerce (the \\nONDC model) multiplied by AI agents creates a network effect: every new participant makes \\nthe network more valuable for agents, and every agent makes the network more valuable for \\nparticipants. \\nFinOps — Value Creation Platform \\nManaging money is managing resource allocation — the ability to de-risk and increase \\npossibility. This is one of the oldest and most universal problems in organisations. We are \\nbuilding a platform that goes beyond traditional expense management into intelligent, \\ndecentralised resource allocation — enabling smart spending, procurement automation, and \\nAI-driven research for purchases. This integrates deeply with Xyne’s collaboration layer, because \\nresource allocation decisions are fundamentally collaborative decisions. \\n\\n\\nQuery: What tracks are mentioned?\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T11:00:54.290Z\",\n      \"durationMs\": 0,\n      \"response\": {\n        \"answer\": \"Mock answer based on document section.\",\n        \"entities\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"concept\",\n            \"name\": \"Mock Entity\",\n            \"confidence\": 0.9\n          }\n        ],\n        \"relevantExcerpt\": \"Mock relevant excerpt from the document.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"agentType\": \"synthesis\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"system\",\n          \"content\": \"You are a synthesis agent. Combine multiple partial answers into a coherent, comprehensive response.\\nMaintain accuracy and cite sources. Remove redundancy while preserving all unique information.\\nRespond with JSON: { \\\"answer\\\": \\\"synthesized answer\\\", \\\"confidence\\\": 0.0-1.0 }\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"role\": \"user\",\n          \"content\": \"Original Query: What tracks