r-facing agent-driven purchasing. This is the infrastructure layer for a \\nnew kind of commerce where agents negotiate, compare, and transact on behalf of humans and \\nbusinesses. \\nThe compounding effect: Agent transaction volume is on an S-curve of its own. Early \\nposition on these rails compounds as the curve steepens. And decentralised commerce (the \\nONDC model) multiplied by AI agents creates a network effect: every new participant makes \\nthe network more valuable for agents, and every agent makes the network more valuable for \\nparticipants. \\nFinOps — Value Creation Platform \\nManaging money is managing resource allocation — the ability to de-risk and increase \\npossibility. This is one of the oldest and most universal problems in organisations. We are \\nbuilding a platform that goes beyond traditional expense management into intelligent, \\ndecentralised resource allocation — enabling smart spending, procurement automation, and \\nAI-driven research for purchases. This integrates deeply with Xyne’s collaboration layer, because \\nresource allocation decisions are fundamentally collaborative decisions. \\n\\n\\nQuery: What tracks are mentioned?\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T11:00:54.290Z\",\n        \"durationMs\": 0,\n        \"response\": {\n          \"answer\": \"Mock answer based on document section.\",\n          \"entities\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"concept\",\n              \"name\": \"Mock Entity\",\n              \"confidence\": 0.9\n            }\n          ],\n          \"relevantExcerpt\": \"Mock relevant excerpt from the document.\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"mergeResult\": {\n    \"type\": \"synthesis\",\n    \"reasoning\": \"Multiple sections synthesized into comprehensive answer\",\n    \"durationMs\": 1,\n    \"llmCall\": {\n      \"agentType\": \"synthesis\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"system\",\n          \"content\": \"You are a sy